      "zh": "脚本编辑器支持 **Python 语法高亮**：新建/编辑脚本弹窗里关键字、字符串、注释、数字、`def`/`class` 名、装饰器、常用内置分别着色，三引号多行字符串跨行续染不断层；配色跟随深浅主题自动切换，只染前景不盖背景，不影响搜索高亮",
      "en": "Python syntax highlighting in the script editor: keywords, strings, comments, numbers, def/class names, decorators and common builtins are colored in the new/edit script dialog; triple-quoted strings keep their color across lines, and the palette follows the light/dark theme automatically — foreground only, so search highlighting still works"
    },
    {
      "zh": "JSON **树视图改成 Fiddler 风格**：新增「类型」列，每个节点直接显示 object / array / string / number / boolean / null（与值列同一套类型配色），结构一眼看清、不用悬停看 tooltip；列序为 键 | 类型 | 值，类型紧挨着键，值列吃满剩余宽度",
      "en": "The JSON tree view now follows Fiddler's style: a new Type column shows object / array / string / number / boolean / null for every node (same type palette as the Value column), so the structure is readable at a glance without hovering for tooltips; columns are Key | Type | Value so the type sits next to the key while the value column takes the remaining width"
    },
    {
      "zh": "JSON 树视图新增 **「层级」菜单**：全部展开 / 展开到第 3 层 / 第 2 层 / 第 1 层 / 全部收起，逐层钻取大 JSON 而不用一步 expandAll 卡死；某个节点自身子节点超过 100 个时该分支保持折叠（仍可手动展开，只是不自动展开），避免几千行一次性铺开",
      "en": "New Level menu in the JSON tree view: expand all / expand to level 3 / 2 / 1 / collapse all, so large JSON can be drilled into layer by layer instead of freezing on a one-shot expandAll; branches with more than 100 children stay folded (still expandable manually, just not auto-expanded) so thousands of rows never pour out at once"
